      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Permanent settlement began in 1850 when families sought arable land for subsistence farming amid Utah's arid conditions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Draper,_Utah",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the Walker War, tensions with Ute tribes led Brigham Young to order fortifications of outlying settlements like Draper.",
